---
// 20 concurrent GETs right after a hot key expired (capture beside the figure).
// Plain endpoint: 20 responses marked MISS, 20 database reads, wall 0.08 s.
// Guarded endpoint: 1 MISS, 1 database read, wall 0.09 s.
const W = 900, H = 330;
const N = 20;
const panels = [
  { x: 20, red: true, title: { en: 'plain cache-aside', vi: 'cache-aside thường' }, path: '/cases/C-1',
    reads: '20', note: { en: '20 requests all missed, all asked the database', vi: '20 request đều miss, đều hỏi database' }, wall: '0.08 s' },
  { x: 470, red: false, title: { en: 'with a lock (single-flight)', vi: 'có khoá (single-flight)' }, path: '/cases/C-1/guarded',
    reads: '1', note: { en: '1 rebuilt it; 19 waited and read the cache', vi: '1 request dựng lại; 19 request chờ rồi đọc cache' }, wall: '0.09 s' },
];
---
<figure class="bep8t">
  <div class="bep8t-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two panels, each with a row of twenty requests arriving after a hot key expired. Left, plain cache-aside: all twenty go to the database, twenty reads, outlined in red. Right, with a lock: one request rebuilds the key, nineteen wait and read the cache, one database read.">
    {panels.map((p) => (
      <g>
        <text x={p.x + 205} y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>{p.title.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.title.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x + 205} y="46" text-anchor="middle" class="code">GET {p.path}</text>
        {Array.from({ length: N }).map((_, i) => (
          <circle cx={p.x + 25 + i * 18} cy="84" r="6" class={p.red ? 'dot red' : i === 0 ? 'dot win' : 'dot'} />
        ))}
        <line x1={p.x + 205} y1="100" x2={p.x + 205} y2="152" class={p.red ? 'ln red' : 'ln'} />
        <polygon points={`${p.x + 205},166 ${p.x + 199},152 ${p.x + 211},152`} class={p.red ? 'hd red' : 'hd'} />
        <rect x={p.x + 85} y="166" width="240" height="84" rx="10" class={p.red ? 'box redbox' : 'box goldbox'} />
        <text x={p.x + 205} y="204" text-anchor="middle" class={p.red ? 'num red' : 'num'}>{p.reads}</text>
        <text x={p.x + 205} y="230" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>database {p.reads === '1' ? 'read' : 'reads'}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lần đọc database</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x + 205} y="278" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>{p.note.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.note.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x + 205} y="302" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>wall time {p.wall}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tổng thời gian {p.wall}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The key had just expired and 20 requests arrived together. Both versions answered in about the same wall time; the difference is how many of them hit the database.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Key vừa hết hạn và 20 request đến cùng lúc. Hai phiên bản trả lời trong thời gian gần như nhau; khác nhau ở chỗ có bao nhiêu request chạm vào database.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8t { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8t-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8t svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep8t text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8t .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15.5px; }
  .bep8t .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8t .b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep8t .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8t .num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8t .num.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8t .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8t .dot.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8t .dot.win { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .bep8t .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8t .box.redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8t .box.goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep8t .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep8t .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep8t .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8t .hd.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8t figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
